	(text_box "Operation description:\n----------------------------\nWhen 12V input is present:\nP-Channel MOSFET (${/c45055c7-108f-41ae-bb4e-be9b30358844/e973a944-f6d5-4e3f-bd48-6f91931e6c94:VALUE}) is OFF. TPS61088 is cut from the output\n\nThe Diode (${/c45055c7-108f-41ae-bb4e-be9b30358844/4ae50ac6-3b3d-44a3-834c-3e996e29b59c:VALUE}) is forward biased, allowing the current pass almost directly to the load from 12V Input jack\n\nWhen 12V input is missing:\nP-Channel MOSFET's gate is pulled down by R1 (${/c45055c7-108f-41ae-bb4e-be9b30358844/c5e9b9df-966b-4ba2-8a3e-56f00b4b3342:VALUE}), connecting the battery to the load\n\nThe Diode is reverse biased, blocking current from leaking back into the 12V Input line"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 235.204 223.52 0)
		(size 46.99 35.56)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
		(stroke
			(width 0)
			(type solid)
		)
		(fill
			(type none)
		)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "86c09651-3c35-4c62-8256-1fd3b2caecff")
	)
	(text_box "              Calculated Values\n----------------------------\nPhase Margin: 51.4°\nGain Margin: 10.4 dB\nCrossover Frequency: 51.8kHz\n----------------------------\nParameters: 1A->2A transient, 6V input\n\n-Inductor Current (Peak-Peak): 5.1A\n-Average Input Current: 4.3A \n\nProvided by: TI WEBENCH"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 231.14 107.95 0)
		(size 46.99 35.56)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
		(stroke
